{:edb/db-before-t 9979 :edb/db-after-t 9980 :edb/tx-data [[13194139543292 50 "2026-10-28T17:42:53.301Z" 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064800 1068 17592186062857 13194139543292 17592186576411 false] [17592186064800 1068 17592186730156 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064800 1068 17592186730157 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064800 1068 17592186730158 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064800 1068 17592186730159 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064800 1071 "![](images/d6/d6aac3a5a7130f9524486d9a2d8fe8778e14a45f68ea3e94454d6c407502c960.png)\n\nThe graph of $y = f(x)$ is plotted above. What are the $x$-coordinates of the critical points?" 13194139543292 17592186576411 false] [17592186064800 1071 "![](images/d6/d6aac3a5a7130f9524486d9a2d8fe8778e14a45f68ea3e94454d6c407502c960.png)\n\nThe graph of $y = f(x)$ is plotted above. What are the $x$-coordinates of the critical points?\n\nSelect all that apply." 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064802 1068 17592186062869 13194139543292 17592186576411 false] [17592186064802 1068 17592186730170 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064802 1068 17592186730171 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064802 1068 17592186730172 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064802 1068 17592186730173 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186064802 1071 "![](images/e0/e06edfc459165563c9c77b4a3439dc0b98e2b94ded708989657d0c60490169d7.png)\n\nThe graph of $y = f(x)$ is plotted above. What are the $x$-coordinates of the stationary points?" 13194139543292 17592186576411 false] [17592186064802 1071 "![](images/e0/e06edfc459165563c9c77b4a3439dc0b98e2b94ded708989657d0c60490169d7.png)\n\nThe graph of $y = f(x)$ is plotted above. What are the $x$-coordinates of the stationary points?\n\nSelect all that apply." 13194139543292 17592186576411 true] [17592186238006 1068 17592186668172 13194139543292 17592186576411 false] [17592186238008 1068 17592186237713 1319413